<title>USA: Hawaiian Air April load factor up 1.7 points.</title>
<headline>Hawaiian Air April load factor up 1.7 points.</headline>
<dateline>HONOLULU 1997-05-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hawaiian Airlines Inc reported April traffic Friday.</p>
<p>					     1996		  1995</p>
<p> Load factor - percent		  80.4		78.7</p>
<p> Revenue passenger miles	     376.4	     324.4</p>
<p> Available seat miles		  468.2	     412.0</p>
<p> Total cargo ton miles		   5.4		 4.2</p>
<p>				    Year-to-date</p>
<p> Load factor - percent		  73.3		76.1</p>
<p> Revenue passenger miles	   1,355.4	   1,259.8</p>
<p> Available seat miles		1,848.8	   1,656.3</p>
<p> Total cargo ton miles		  18.9		15.9</p>
<p>(Revenue passenger and available seat miles in millions)</p>
</text>
